B.agh=new A.jk('"Enter a valid amount"',"Use digits only, for example 25000 (no commas or letters).")
B.agp=new A.jk("No Add, Edit or Delete button","Your role does not allow it. Ask your admin.")
B.ags=new A.jk('"Access Denied"',"Ask your admin to add that page to your role.")
B.agq=new A.jk('"Failed to load\u2026"',"Tap Retry or Refresh and check your internet connection.")
B.agj=new A.jk("An upload or download shows a red icon","Tap the progress icon at the top right. The failed row shows the reason. Tap the retry arrow to try again, or the X to dismiss it.")
B.ago=new A.jk("I downloaded a file on my phone but cannot find it",'Wait for the "Save to" screen to open after the progress icon finishes, choose Downloads and tap Save. If you close that screen, nothing is saved. Download again.')
B.agn=new A.jk("The website signed me out","For safety, the website signs you out after 30 minutes with no clicks, taps or typing. This also applies when you close the tab and open the site again later: if more than 30 minutes have passed, you have to sign in again. It will not sign you out while a file is uploading or downloading. The Android app stays signed in.")
B.agr=new A.jk("Download opens a new tab instead of saving","The browser blocked a direct download. Save the file from the new tab. If it keeps happening, ask your admin to allow downloads in the storage settings.")
B.agl=new A.jk("I cannot delete a category","Some expenses still use it. Change those expenses to another category first. The six built-in categories can be edited but never deleted.")
B.agk=new A.jk("The Archive ZIP is slow or fails","Large projects (over about 500 MB) can fail in the browser. Create the archive in smaller parts: tick only some kinds of files each time.")
B.agt=new A.jk("I do not see the Export or Archive buttons","They are for admins only, on the project Overview tab. Ask your admin.")
