B.ai4=new A.aj("Reports","A new Reports page with ten reports (profit and loss, income, expense, cash flow, vendor statement, labour, payroll sheet, project summary, material usage, pending and due). Add charts, compare with the previous period, save a report to repeat it, and download it as PDF or Excel.",B.xW)
B.agT=new A.aj("Labour Ledger","A new page for your workers: days worked this week and month (taken from Labour expenses), wages paid, and advances given and taken back. Search for a worker by typing a few letters.",B.i7)
B.agZ=new A.aj("Better labour expenses",'Add a whole group of workers at once (untick whoever is absent), tick several workers with the same salary in one go, pay for more than one day with "More than one day", deduct an advance from a wage, and get a warning if a worker, material, sub contractor or equipment was already added that day.',B.h2)
B.ajJ=new A.aj("Labour advance from the Expense page","A small wallet icon at the top right of the Expense page, and in the Add Expense form next to the X, lets you give a worker an advance without opening the Labour Ledger. You only see it if your role allows giving advances.",B.xP)
B.ahC=new A.aj("Weeks on the Labour Ledger",'"This week" now runs Friday to Thursday. You can change the start day or add your own weeks such as Thu-Wed with the calendar-edit icon next to the period box.',B.ya)
B.ajL=new A.aj("Vendors: paid or not paid","When you add an expense with a vendor, choose Paid or Not paid. Each vendor card has a Payment history dropdown showing every payment by date.",B.jb)
B.ahU=new A.aj("Android app and website","The website has an Android icon on the Dashboard to download the app. For safety, the website signs you out after 30 minutes of no activity.",B.xT)
B.ajs=new A.aj("Quick add for expenses","On the Expense page, tap the \u26a1 button to add an expense in one line: amount, category, project, then Enter.",B.q8)
B.ajd=new A.aj("Your own expense categories","In the Add Expense form, tap Manage beside CATEGORY to add, rename, re-color or delete categories. Built-in ones can be edited but not deleted.",B.h1)
B.alN=new A.af(983784,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aj2=new A.aj("Uploads and downloads in the background","Forms close right away while files upload. A small progress icon at the top right shows every upload and download with its percentage.",B.alN)
B.aiI=new A.aj("Download and share files","Every file row has a blue download arrow. On a phone it asks where to save the file (choose Downloads). Receipts can also be shared to WhatsApp or email. On the Documents page you can tick several files and download them together.",B.hG)
B.ahc=new A.aj("Receipts only when you ask",'A payment receipt is made only when "Generate Payment Receipt" is switched on. It is off by default when you edit an income.',B.ej)
B.aho=new A.aj("Excel export and archive (admin)","On a project, admins can export details to an Excel file you choose the parts of, create a ZIP archive with all files and receipts, and delete chosen files to free up storage.",B.mN)
B.ajm=new A.aj("Help Center views","Switch between Steps and Text view with the toggle at the top right. On a wide screen the guides open in two panes.",B.y1)
