B.aiv=new A.aj("Steps view","Topic cards and a step-by-step walkthrough. On a wide screen the guide list is on the left and the steps on the right.",B.H4)
B.aiX=new A.aj("Text view","One long page with every guide written out in numbered steps. The app remembers your choice.",B.GE)
