B.aii=new A.aj("Tap the download icon","Every file row has a small blue download arrow. It is on the Documents page (project documents, design files, income and expense files, and payment receipts), on income and expense attachments, and on files in a project's Income tab.",B.hG)
B.agH=new A.aj("Watch the progress",'The progress icon at the top right shows the percentage. On a computer the file goes to your Downloads folder. On a phone a "Save to" screen opens when the file is ready: choose Downloads (or any folder) and tap Save. Then find it in your Files app.',B.GM)
B.ah1=new A.aj("Friendly names",'A receipt downloads as "Receipt_<income title>_<date>.pdf". Other files keep their own names.',B.kR)
B.ah7=new A.aj("If the browser blocks it","If your browser will not let the app save the file directly, the file opens in a new tab instead. Use the browser's save option there. If this keeps happening, ask your admin to allow downloads in the storage settings.",B.kW)
B.ajX=new A.aj("Just want to look at a file?","On the Income and Expense lists, tap an attachment to open it in a new tab. The Documents page shows only the download arrow, so download the file to open it.",B.mS)
