B.agO=new A.aj("Tap the lightning button","On the Expense page, tap the small \u26a1 button at the top right, next to the Refresh icon. The Quick add bar opens at the top of the page. Tap \u26a1 again, or the X, to hide it.",B.q8)
B.aiK=new A.aj("Type the amount",'The cursor is already in the Amount box. Type a number such as 450. Optionally type what it was for, for example "Cement".',B.ek)
B.agA=new A.aj("Pick category, project and mode","Tap a category chip, choose the project and the payment mode. The app remembers your last choices, so next time you only type the amount.",B.h1)
B.al7=new A.af(63538,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.ai7=new A.aj("Press Enter or tap Add","The expense is saved with today's date. The bar stays open and clears, ready for the next one. Tap Undo in the message at the bottom if you made a mistake, and the X to hide the bar when you are done.",B.al7)
B.ahG=new A.aj("Add details later","Quick add skips vendor, material, worker and bill photos. To add those, open the entry with the three dots (\u22ee), then Edit.",B.c7)
B.b6Q=s([B.agO,B.aiK,B.agA,B.ai7,B.ahG],t.W)
B.afK=new A.bW("Quick add (fastest way)",B.cr,B.b6Q)
B.ak4=new A.aj("Tap Add Expense","The button is at the bottom right of the Expense page.",B.eh)
B.aji=new A.aj("Choose a Category","Material, Labour, Sub Cont., Equipment, Water or Other. The form changes with your choice.",B.h1)
B.ahT=new A.aj("Category details","Material: pick material, sub-material and Quantity.\nLabour: pick the Worker. The Amount fills in from that worker's salary on the Workers list; change it if today's pay is different.\nSub Cont.: pick the Sub Contractor (tap Manage to add one).\nEquipment: pick the equipment.",B.jd)
B.aiS=new A.aj("Main details","Enter Name, Amount, Date and Project. Project is required.",B.ib)
B.ajo=new A.aj("Vendor and bill","Pick a Vendor if you bought from one (optional) and attach a photo of the bill.",B.jb)
B.ahj=new A.aj("Paid or Not paid","After you pick a vendor, choose Not paid or Paid. Not paid adds the amount to that vendor's Pending balance (you still owe it). Paid adds it to the vendor's Paid amount instead. Editing or deleting the expense updates the vendor automatically.",B.i9)
B.ahu=new A.aj("Save","Tap Save Expense. The form closes right away and any attached bill uploads in the background; watch the progress icon at the top right.",B.bW)
B.bep=s([B.ak4,B.aji,B.ahT,B.aiS,B.ajo,B.ahj,B.ahu],t.W)
B.afp=new A.bW("Add an expense",B.cr,B.bep)
B.ajD=new A.aj("Choose Labour and a worker",'Pick the Labour category, then a Worker. Workers already added on the chosen date are listed last, marked "Added".',B.i7)
B.agU=new A.aj('Tap "Add more workers with the same salary"',"After you pick a worker, this blue line appears under the Worker box if other workers earn the same. Tap it and the list of those workers opens right there.",B.h2)
B.ahA=new A.aj("Tick the workers","Tick each worker you want. Workers already added that day are greyed out. A line below shows how many entries and the total.",B.fr)
B.aiF=new A.aj("Save","Pick the project and tap Save Expense. You get one entry per worker, all with the same date, amount, mode and name. A bill you attach is added to every entry.",B.bW)
B.bcY=s([B.ajD,B.agU,B.ahA,B.aiF],t.W)
B.afD=new A.bW("Add labour for several workers at once",B.cr,B.bcY)
B.ahH=new A.aj('Tap "Add a group of workers"',"With the Labour category chosen, tap this blue line above the Worker box. The single Worker box is hidden and a Group box appears.",B.h2)
B.ai_=new A.aj("Choose the group",'Pick a group such as "Mason team". Its workers appear with tick boxes, all ticked, each with their salary as the amount.',B.fr)
B.aln=new A.af(983147,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.ahI=new A.aj("Untick who did not work","Untick anyone absent today. Workers already added for that date are greyed out. You can change a worker's amount, for example for a half day.",B.aln)
B.aiG=new A.aj("Advances",'A worker with an advance shows "Advance balance". Type an amount in Deduct and their Amount becomes what you pay now. The line at the bottom shows the workers and total to pay.',B.mL)
B.ahN=new A.aj("Save",'Pick the project and tap Save Expense. One entry is saved for each ticked worker. Tap "Choose workers one by one" to go back to the normal Worker box.',B.bW)
B.bdX=s([B.ahH,B.ai_,B.ahI,B.aiG,B.ahN],t.W)
B.ag8=new A.bW("Add labour for a whole group",B.cr,B.bdX)
B.ah8=new A.aj('Tap "More than one day"','With the Labour category chosen, tap the blue "More than one day" link at the right of the Date label.',B.qa)
B.ajI=new A.aj("Tick the days worked","A calendar opens. Tap each day the worker worked, move between months with the arrows, then tap Done.",B.GN)
B.ajP=new A.aj("Save as usual","One entry is saved with the Date as the payment date. The Labour Ledger counts every ticked day as worked. Tap the X on the blue box to go back to a single day.",B.bW)
B.b90=s([B.ah8,B.ajI,B.ajP],t.W)
B.afU=new A.bW("Pay a worker for more than one day",B.cr,B.b90)
B.aiL=new A.aj("Pick a worker who has an advance","If the worker owes you an advance, an amber box shows the balance under the Worker box.",B.mL)
B.agC=new A.aj("Enter the amount to deduct","Type how much of the advance to take out of this wage. The Amount box above changes to what you pay now (wage minus the deduction). Change or clear the deduction and the Amount follows.",B.kU)
B.aj6=new A.aj("Save","The expense is saved with the amount you actually pay, and the deduction lowers the worker's advance balance in the Labour Ledger. The deducted part is not added to Expenses, because the advance was never an expense. Editing or deleting the expense updates the balance too.",B.bW)
B.bcy=s([B.aiL,B.agC,B.aj6],t.W)
B.afP=new A.bW("Deduct an advance from a wage",B.cr,B.bcy)
B.aik=new A.aj("The warning","If a worker already has a Labour entry on the same date in the same project, the app tells you and asks if you want to add another anyway.",B.kW)
B.alO=new A.af(983828,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.ahK=new A.aj("If you change the date or project later",'The check runs again when you change the Date, the "More than one day" days or the Project after choosing. If what you chose is now a repeat, the app asks: Keep it, or Choose another (which clears it so you can pick again). In a group, workers who are now repeats are left out and a message tells you.',B.alO)
B.aiD=new A.aj("Materials, sub contractors and equipment too",'The same check works for these. Items already added for the chosen date and project move to the bottom of the list and are marked "Added". If you pick one again, the app tells you what is already there and asks if you want to add another anyway. For a material with sub-materials, the check is on the sub-material.',B.mP)
B.ajY=new A.aj("Different project is fine","The same worker can be added on a different project on the same day, for example half a day each.",B.H0)
